<Layout title="Contact Yakub Blog" description="Contact Yakub Blog about job circular corrections, updates, and editorial questions.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8"><p class="pill !cursor-default">Contact</p><h1 class="mt-4 font-display text-4xl font-bold text-ink dark:text-paper">Tell us what needs attention.</h1><div class="prose mt-8 max-w-none dark:prose-invert"><p>For corrections, missing notices, or partnership questions, email <a href="mailto:hello@yakub.blog">hello@yakub.blog</a>. Please include the relevant post URL and official source.</p></div></section>
</Layout>
